title: "The Li–Li–Helleseth–Qu Theorem 4 family is entirely Maiorana–McFarland"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "A trace-kernel decomposition proves that the 2023 Li–Li–Helleseth–Qu Theorem 4 bent family is in the completed Maiorana–McFarland class for every parameter. This answers the open class-membership question, not the already established bentness theorem."
